{"id":"absolutamente","lemma":"absolutamente","pos":"adv","rank":1089,"glosses":["absolutely; completely; entirely; totally; utterly; wholly (in absolute manner)"],"ipa":"/ɐb.suˌlu.tɐˈmẽ.tɨ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/3/3b/LL-Q5146_%28por%29-Santamarcanda-absolutamente.wav/LL-Q5146_%28por%29-Santamarcanda-absolutamente.wav.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Isto é absolutamente maravilhoso.","en":"This is absolutely wonderful.","words":[null,null,null,{"g":"wonderful"}],"phrases":[[0,2,"that is"]]},{"text":"Não havia absolutamente nenhuma dúvida.","en":"There was absolutely no doubt.","words":[{"g":"not / no"},{"g":"there be","l":"haver"},null,{"g":"not any, none","l":"nenhum"},{"g":"doubt, uncertainty"}]},{"text":"Eu quero saber absolutamente tudo.","en":"I want to know absolutely everything.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to want","l":"querer"},{"g":"to be aware, to know"},null,{"g":"everything"}]},{"text":"Isso está absolutamente fora de questão.","en":"That's absolutely out of the question.","words":[{"g":"that"},{"g":"is","l":"estar"},null,null,null,{"g":"question"}],"phrases":[[3,5,"outside"]]},{"text":"Não entendi absolutamente nada.","en":"I understood absolutely nothing.","words":[{"g":"not / no"},{"g":"to understand","l":"entender"},null,{"g":"nothing"}]}]}